Sorted print groups entries and orders prices by commodity and date.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight print --sort-declarations

========== API ==========

print({ sortDeclarations: true })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
tag Reviewed
commodity USD
P 2024-03-01 USD 3 SEK
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 USD 2 SEK
commodity EUR
P 2024-02-01 EUR 4 SEK
; First root comment
2024-01-01 Opening ; :Reviewed: memo
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK
2024-01-02 Closing
  Assets:Cash  -1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  1 SEK
; Second root comment
P 2024-01-01 EUR 5 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

; First root comment

; Second root comment

account Assets:Cash

account Equity:Opening

tag Reviewed

commodity SEK
  default

commodity USD

commodity EUR

P 2024-01-01 EUR 5 SEK

P 2024-02-01 EUR 4 SEK

P 2024-01-01 USD 2 SEK

P 2024-03-01 USD 3 SEK

2024-01-01 Opening  ; :Reviewed: memo
    Assets:Cash     1 SEK
    Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

2024-01-02 Closing
